|term[path] :status settled :defined-by def-locations-and-paths :anchor path
  :word path
  :alternates [paths]
  One set of monotonic steps between two locations.
  |invariants
    - Has exactly one [[term/origin]]
    - Has exactly one [[term/destination]]
    - Steps each carry exactly one [[term/sequence-cause]]
    - Not necessarily unique, reversible, or shortest; logical by default
